{"id":"nocturno","lemma":"nocturno","pos":"adj","rank":2883,"glosses":["night","nocturnal"],"ipa":"/noɡˈtuɾno/","forms":{"feminine":"nocturna","masculinePlural":"nocturnos","femininePlural":"nocturnas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-nocturno.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella va a la escuela nocturna.","en":"She goes to night school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515333","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"okay"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"school"},null]},{"text":"Él alzó la mirada hacia el cielo nocturno.","en":"He looked up at the night sky.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333576","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to lift, raise","l":"alzar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"look, glance"},{"g":"toward, towards"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sky"},null]},{"text":"Soy un ave nocturna.","en":"I'm a night owl.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441822","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bird"},null]},{"text":"El turista preguntaba por alojamiento nocturno.","en":"The tourist asked for lodging for the night.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806512","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"tourist"},{"g":"to ask","l":"preguntar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"accommodation"},null]},{"text":"Los gatos son animales nocturnos.","en":"Cats are active at night.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"cat","l":"gato"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"},null]}]}